---
import PageLayout from "~/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import siteConfig from "~/config/site";

const updated = "Last updated: October 2026";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  intro="How visitor data, analytics, and communications are handled."
  description={`Privacy Policy for ${siteConfig.name}.`}
  crumbs={[{ label: "Privacy" }]}
>
  <section class="wrap sec" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="prose rev">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        This portfolio is designed to present technical work, share engineering
        articles, and allow prospective clients or employers to initiate
        contact. Your privacy matters, and data collection is strictly limited
        to what is required for site communication, analytics, and eventual
        content monetization.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics and Traffic Measurement</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics to measure visitor traffic, popular
        content, and usage trends. This helps identify which technical articles
        and case studies provide the most value. The data collected includes
        non-personally identifiable information such as browser type, operating
        system, device category, referring pages, and coarse location. All
        metrics are processed in aggregate.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising and Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Google AdSense may be integrated across journal articles and technical
        posts to display advertisements. Google and its third-party ad partners
        use cookies or unique device identifiers to serve ads based on your
        visit to this website and other sites on the internet.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a
          href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ad Settings</a
        >. You can also opt out of third-party vendor cookies by visiting <a
          href="https://www.aboutads.info"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Form Submissions</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit an inquiry through the contact form or send a direct
        email, the details provided (such as your name, email address, and
        project requirements) are used solely to evaluate your request and
        respond to your message. Your details are never sold, rented, or
        distributed to third-party marketers.
      </p>

      <h2>Server Logs</h2>
      <p>
        Standard web server logs are maintained by the hosting provider for
        security and operational health. These logs record standard network
        details, including IP addresses, timestamps, requested URLs, and user
        agents, retained according to the host platform retention schedule.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Rights and Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to request the deletion of any contact information or
        communication history. If you have questions about this privacy policy
        or wish to remove your messages from active record, reach out directly
        at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`}
          >{siteConfig.contact.email}</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p class="mini muted">{updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
